inity war the majority of  kills are on mindless horde beasts and  the chitari so huge chunks of the action  scenes don't feature any deaths that  count for the purposes of this show  however thanos himself and his  lieutenants they still count now prior  to tony doing his own snap call obsidian  was crushed by scott lang in giant form  and corvus glaive got taken down by  okoye proxima midnight is a little bit  tougher to track you see the actress for  the voice and the facial capture carrie  [ __ ] couldn't make the end game shoot  due to scheduling conflicts now proxima  midnight is still seen in some of the  long shots and group shots played by  stuntwoman monique ganderton so she's  definitely there but since [ __ ] couldn't  do the facial capture she gets no  close-ups and no spotlight so while it  is possible she died during the battle  like obsidian englave did  we don't see it happen so i'm going to  assume she's still alive when tony snaps  thanos forces away so that means tony  gets three for his sacrifice play one  for approximate midnight one for ebony  maw who we do in fact see get dusted and  of course thanos himself  so that  closes out the murderous rampage of one  anthony edward stark aka  iron man how many bodies did he leave in  his wake well let's run the numbers and  find out in his time as iron man tony  stark racked up a total body count of 82  with over half of that coming from his  very first film having significant  appearances in nine marvel films because  i'm not gonna count something like the  cameo in the incredible hulk that means  that on average tony killed  9.11 people per film  of the 82 i am crediting him with 77 of  them were humans of some form with two  having enhancements from extremists and  one being a poor innocent truck driver  tony only had five non-human kills  although one of those non-human kills  was the big batty daddy of them all  thanos  i almost want to count that as more than  one  but in the end he's just one guy like  everybody else no matter what he claims  to be  i am  inevitable  you know what else is inevitable the end  of this inaugural entry in the mcu body  count now next month i'll be taking a  look at how many bodies have been left  behind by the first avenger captain  america aka  steve rogers he had seven appearances to  tony stark's nine but given how many  times tony didn't notch any kills at all  he still might be able to give the old  metal had a run for his money tune in  next month to find out and that wraps us  up if you want to support this project  or anything else that i do patreon is  the best way to do that but i really  want to get your comments on this what  do you think of this project what do you  think about how deadly tony ended up  being was it more than you thought was  it less whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments and let's  talk about it all the like share and  subscribe stuff helps me out as well but  what i really want you to remember my  friends  is that you are beautiful you are valid  and you are loved  you're the council i'm just running the  meetings and until next time this  council is adjourned  [Music]  now my thanks to my highest supporting  patrons robin moore zubin lutfullah  barack the thing that goes doink in the  anime oliver b melinda walters and  delkey the oath the boy bernabby lacks  the poodle zach idolin tracy skravit  angry casper bookworm  adam rdl taylor shane ross ring borlay  brendan the rose and tt  you want to hear me possibly butcher  your name check out the rewards on the  patreon  and thanks to all you friends  [Music]  [Music]  so  um  [Music]


